\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Checkpointing and thread IDs\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 The problem, demonstrated: tell CineBot "my name is Mayank", then ask "who am I?" \'97 it has no idea.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 from langgraph.checkpoint.memory import InMemorySaver\
\
checkpointer = InMemorySaver()\
agent = create_agent(model=..., tools=[...], checkpointer=checkpointer)\
\
config = \{"configurable": \{"thread_id": "mayank-session-1"\}\}\
agent.invoke(\{"messages": [...]\}, config)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 Adding a checkpointer makes 
\f2\fs26 config
\f0\fs24  mandatory \'97 the saver needs to know which thread it's saving under. Change the 
\f2\fs26 thread_id
\f0\fs24  and the agent no longer knows you; the history belongs to the other thread.\
In production the thread ID is a UUID generated per session, never a hand-written string. One session, one thread; a user can have many.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 7. Context schema\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 For pre-run configuration \'97 user ID, API keys, feature flags \'97 pass it as 
\f2\fs26 context
\f0\fs24  alongside 
\f2\fs26 config
\f0\fs24 :\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 from dataclasses import dataclass\
\
@dataclass\
class TravelerContext:\
    user_id: str\
    home_currency: str\
    membership_tier: str\
\
agent = create_agent(..., context_schema=TravelerContext)\
\
agent.invoke(\
    \{"messages": [...], "is_premium_member": False\},\
    config=config,\
    context=TravelerContext(user_id="rohan01", home_currency="INR", membership_tier="standard"),\
)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 Same lesson as the state schema: the agent has to be told what shape the extra data takes before middleware and tools can use it. You can't just throw arbitrary keys at it.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 The assembled agent\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs26 \cf0 full_tripmate = create_agent(\
    model=model,\
    tools=[get_real_weather, tavily_search, save_trip, get_saved_trips, book_premium_concierge],\
    system_prompt="...",\
    middleware=[gate_premium_tools],\
    checkpointer=checkpointer,       # conversation history\
    store=travel_store,              # preferences\
    context_schema=TravelerContext,  # pre-run config\
    state_schema=TripState,\
    response_format=ToolStrategy(Union[NewTripRequest, ModifyTripRequest, CancelTripRequest]),\
    name="tripmate",\
)\
